<title>USA: Wet Seal stake held by Zweig-DiMenna.</title>
<headline>Wet Seal stake held by Zweig-DiMenna.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by Zweig-DiMenna Associated LLC said Monday it holds a 7.1 percent stake in Wet Seal Inc, or 752,900 Class A common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it bought a net 713,200 shares between November 5 and January 7 at prices ranging from $13.7708 to $26.0234 a share.</p>
<p>The group holds the stake for investment purposes, the filing said.</p>
